---
/** "Turn instructions into checks" section: assertion table with sticky header. */
---

<section class="recorder-assertions recorder-wrap">
  <header>
    <p class="recorder-index">DEFINE YOUR CHECKS</p>
    <h2 class="recorder-display">Turn instructions<br />into checks.</h2>
    <p class="recorder-assertions-intro">
      A dyno translates skill requirements into deterministic assertions. Each
      result connects a requirement to evidence captured during the run.
    </p>
    <a class="recorder-text-link" href="https://docs.dynobox.xyz/config-authoring/#assertions">Read the assertion reference <span>→</span></a>
  </header>
  <div class="recorder-check-table" role="region" aria-label="Assertion checks" tabindex="0">
    <table>
      <caption>Assertion checks and observed evidence</caption>
      <colgroup>
        <col class="is-check" />
        <col class="is-proof" />
        <col class="is-evidence" />
        <col class="is-status" />
      </colgroup>
      <thead>
        <tr><th scope="col">CHECK</th><th scope="col">WHAT IT ASSERTS</th><th scope="col">OBSERVED EVIDENCE</th><th scope="col">STATUS</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td><code>skill.referenced</code></td><td>Observe a dyno authoring skill reference</td><td>dyno-from-skill / SKILL.md</td><td>PASS</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>http.called</code></td><td>Observe the authoring reference request</td><td>config-authoring.md · status 200</td><td>PASS</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>artifact.exists</code></td><td>Find the generated dyno in the work directory</td><td>dyno / wordcount.dyno.mjs</td><td>PASS</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>artifact.contains</code></td><td>Find the Dynobox SDK import</td><td>defineDyno · @dynobox/sdk</td><td>PASS</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>command.notCalled</code></td><td>Observe no command that runs the dyno</td><td>no dynobox run observed</td><td>PASS</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>verify.command</code></td><td>Check that validation exits successfully</td><td>dynobox validate · exit 0</td><td>PASS</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .recorder-assertions {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(290px, 0.55fr) minmax(600px, 1.45fr);
    gap: clamp(60px, 9vw, 130px);
    align-items: start;
    padding-block: 130px 150px;
  }

  .recorder-assertions > header {
    position: sticky;
    top: 140px;
  }

  .recorder-assertions-intro {
    max-width: 440px;
    margin: 28px 0 0;
    color: #555;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .recorder-check-table {
    margin-top: 43px;
    overflow-x: auto;
  }

  .recorder-check-table table {
    width: 100%;
    min-width: 640px;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    table-layout: fixed;
  }

  .recorder-check-table caption {
    position: absolute;
    width: 1px;
    height: 1px;
    padding: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);
    white-space: nowrap;
    border: 0;
  }

  .recorder-check-table col.is-check {
    width: 22%;
  }

  .recorder-check-table col.is-proof {
    width: 34%;
  }

  .recorder-check-table col.is-evidence {
    width: 34%;
  }

  .recorder-check-table col.is-status {
    width: 10%;
  }

  .recorder-check-table th,
  .recorder-check-table td {
    padding: 15px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--paper-line);
    text-align: left;
    vertical-align: middle;
  }

  .recorder-check-table th + th,
  .recorder-check-table td + td {
    padding-left: 18px;
  }

  .recorder-check-table th {
    color: var(--paper-muted);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .recorder-check-table code {
    color: #555;
    font-size: 10px;
  }

  .recorder-check-table td:nth-child(2) {
    color: #222;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  .recorder-check-table td:nth-child(3) {
    color: #666;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10px;
  }

  .recorder-check-table th:last-child,
  .recorder-check-table td:last-child {
    padding-left: 8px;
    text-align: right;
  }

  .recorder-check-table td:last-child {
    color: #397c52;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1080px) {
    .recorder-assertions {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }

    .recorder-assertions > * {
      min-width: 0;
    }

    .recorder-assertions > header {
      position: static;
      max-width: 700px;
    }

    .recorder-check-table {
      margin-top: 0;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .recorder-assertions {
      padding-block: 90px 100px;
    }
  }
</style>
